        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a730" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts533" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts536">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Se: r..., *este** a:mo moneki ok se: se: *morral** ikase: tato:kas, yehwa ya *servi:rowa** se: kikwi wa:n.... Ke:mah wa:n takwa:wak</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
